 "notes": [
  "spine: dsfd_sp_su_h stops in the order col 2 down (from QN0), col 1 up, col 0 down; SRD 2 relay stations a stop in the channels (adjacent tile centres ~620 um)",
  "pin owners po0..po3 sit directly W of f_vm (NE corner): VM read / write slots 4 each; NRL 4 relay stations on every pin owner link (the stack spans ~2 mm)",
  "csu / dsu (c_cmd / c_done, cck) reach the control tile over NRC 5 relay stations (~2.25 mm, <= 500 um a station)",
  "f_vm is the contract VM hub port (1,024 b); the slab RTL VM interface is 16 read + 16 write row slots (rq / rs / wq): the VM hub binding is the generator's, its endpoint next to po0..po3",
  "f_capture / t_hc are die hub pins of the contract that dsfd_sp_su_h does not bind (no capture / HC port in the SU engine): generator to route through or retire"
 ]
